    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry Fitzgerald are delighted to present 6 Cois Glaisin Avenue, a beautifully presented 3 bedroom semi-detached home that spans across approximately 106 square meters. The property benefits from ample off-street parking to the front of the property along with a generously sized back garden to retreat to for the evening.\n\nInternally, this A rated home really shines you are greeted with a stylish sitting room, with plenty of space for all the family, further down the hall the bright kitchen brings light to the heart of the home. Upstairs the property has 3 bedrooms, one currently in use as a home office and 2 other bedrooms that are both well-apportioned, the master benefitting from an ensuite which only adds to the appeal of this home.\n\nThe property is located just 5 minutes from the M3 providing easy access to any commuters to Dublin. Johnstown village also provides a plentiful amount of amenities with schools, shops, cafés and recreational facilities all only a short walk or cycle from this home. The home is also within easy reach of Navan Town Centre which further boosts the amenities available to this home.\n\nThis property is sure to appeal to a broad spectrum of buyers, contact us to get your viewing. Early viewing is advised."
      },
